{"objects":[{"id":"flow","instance":"instance--b96dad5f-c519-5a1f-a718-912ca4a86c02","objects":["attack-action--1","attack-action--2","attack-action--3","attack-action--4","attack-action--5","attack-action--6","attack-action--7","attack-action--8","attack-action--9","attack-action--10","attack-condition--1","instance--ba7fbf23-ebf9-5343-b58e-c46544d10fc6","instance--bdc6cafd-6c91-5411-8e68-87ba0e0fc4a5","file--sharedll","file--msharedll","instance--0e85b045-4aaf-559f-b1a5-3c4a69dac3ee","software--mikrotik-router","instance--ddd3f935-ba81-5c1e-96ec-58223268cb2d","domain-name--emerdns-backup","instance--48beff37-7d72-53a4-b14d-0f6e3bd57a0c","instance--3247291d-44c1-55fb-84dd-95ff6aa84684","ipv4-addr--81-91-234-196","domain-name--unnamed-domain","software--tor","instance--9b1f08be-90a4-5ce4-b338-537c0d5ab0e9","instance--7284a49b-660d-5171-8bd3-6aa689328372","instance--db721123-f758-5bd4-9937-c0f05cbaf87c","instance--ce4b4cdd-421f-5726-b611-9f50faa6cc64","instance--29c47e0c-46af-50d2-8ed7-12e34c6476a0","instance--3536a568-610f-5570-bba9-6dfe97bc9c2e","instance--384798bd-a84b-5feb-8d38-7f9d0a087f11","instance--ed6039fe-678b-5ae9-9576-73e6ea35b0c8","instance--338a08d1-596c-5134-86e1-58bc27da7116","instance--b6d82c28-0a68-5c6f-b058-c1e072f51852","instance--3622ace1-abf1-5f6e-a5de-a6f584dc1f66","instance--56b40d44-cc57-5e8b-b320-779a685089fd","instance--895aab9a-87c3-51d8-91f8-cc3f6dd1a5a5","instance--3bb881aa-a5ab-51ba-b53d-89d26964ce7d","instance--b3aa1b20-0a98-5bee-9b24-afe8c9468e2a","instance--7b0e0d86-8954-5a8a-8a0c-239ea9cbf4d4","instance--f14b473c-f77d-5735-a7eb-67d4210482f1","instance--52476607-c180-574b-a37d-4e939459a5d0","instance--8fb2db66-9ca0-55f2-bd54-460f08ab6188","instance--1338044e-bcdd-5a19-86b2-374ca70d8151","instance--dabc658d-36b8-5ef9-a441-894d8da4feb5","instance--a2340d65-0364-59fe-b4c3-af183235ac82","instance--5bd27a78-b292-5011-9fd4-38f3e897ad9e","instance--3572bc88-c9df-590c-8622-5359411c1efc","instance--f50df5cc-46d3-50c9-9806-2917f442c32a","instance--d945a78d-f1bf-5d10-be29-7c5bad808ebd","instance--f4c40070-300e-53ab-bd58-8602374d3865","instance--e7ddf086-26fe-532b-9367-58fb684f7021","instance--ddcfe27c-078e-51aa-b6e8-fd799eb32198","instance--e07a7f8f-07e3-51d7-bc6a-8c3d9715e688","instance--edc61317-d46c-51cb-bf84-d1b2f448faf5","instance--d05e88da-b686-5fd8-931e-9d1ecd7c5f84","instance--a7a0eb3a-ad4c-5480-a87e-0704ed1f24cd"],"properties":[["name","TrickBot post-takedown infrastructure and update behavior"],["description","Bitdefender analysis of updated TrickBot samples after the 2020 takedown attempts, describing update signing, C2 infrastructure, backup domain use, and plugin server configuration changes."],["scope","campaign"],["author",[["name","Liviu ARSENE"]]],["external_references",[["item-1",[["source_name","www.bitdefender.com"],["url","https://www.bitdefender.com/blog/labs/trickbot-is-dead-long-live-trickbot/"]]]]]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ad592d05-6969-5b51-98a8-1ad9b6aab896","120":"instance--5850a8f4-8241-5e73-9bf0-dcd376cd5025","150":"instance--0da1498f-3beb-5916-a249-e0410a4a81e4","180":"instance--d3632784-7391-5a29-83e2-edab51db56c6","210":"instance--8bc47ca5-ca73-5a04-a9ea-918608f10871","240":"instance--6546eef6-c5ad-516e-a417-89916e651648","270":"instance--244e5a69-f465-564e-9d2c-93d4da44fc57","30":"instance--6a1fca3c-fdb6-536a-bbea-61ac2349a700","300":"instance--043a5b44-2864-5565-abce-1909204e5485","330":"instance--e10eb918-2b0b-56f4-9c82-f345ce21276c","60":"instance--33a99d1b-dad8-51f6-be74-e1614db9151b","90":"instance--380c79e9-b1eb-547c-bf01-a011db1201c1"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Push new TrickBot versions"],["description","The group behind TrickBot seems to have actively pushed new versions of the Trojan and maintained the full list of modules used in previous versions."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0042","technique":"T1587.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Pack lateral movement module"],["description","However, in the recently analyzed samples, it seems that the shareDll \u2013 or mshareDll in its packed version \u2013 was no longer present. In fact, now there\u2019s only the shareDll, which is packed, with mshareDll completely removed. This probably indicates that TrickBot operators are moving away from unpacked modules, cleaning up their list of lateral movement modules to only use packed ones."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1027"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Sign update responses with bcrypt"],["description","In terms of communication between victims and C&Cs, TrickBot update responses seem to have been digitally signed using , potentially in an effort to impede future takedowns. This particular improvement ensures that each new update for TrickBot is legitimate. This particular behavior was observed for the version, but not for the version."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1600"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Use Mikrotik routers as C2"],["description","The C&C servers for the \u201c \u201d version seem to involve only the use of Mikrotik routers:"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0042","technique":"T1583.005"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a469636c-0cb2-50b9-92f9-644c8aa98197","120":"instance--d57b3a21-e910-5879-8148-40165cea451a","150":"instance--58250ef4-5bb4-5bf3-b33e-89493bbb395d","180":"instance--3e769cf2-c1e5-5d2e-81d4-892f48ce4d86","210":"instance--f6499e41-749c-5d7f-9346-96c08d0d5dfd","240":"instance--d9dcdfc8-5f42-546a-803a-0efcd5d4cf91","270":"instance--c9afd0f6-97ce-57b2-9d60-3557b6214809","30":"instance--75f82155-f5ff-5619-8bf8-aae22937cab0","300":"instance--25e2d26e-1b35-56bd-b9aa-096c2d3b0e3c","330":"instance--e0483688-da10-5376-8cf2-050bcc3b70f0","60":"instance--1293d9cc-16b2-5c67-a453-bd144aab133a","90":"instance--2b43cd52-10db-5b15-8ad5-c4b59496528b"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--5","properties":[["name","Use EmerDNS backup domain"],["description","Another interesting change is that, among the updated C&C sever list, there\u2019s also an EmerDNS domain used as a backup in case no known C&C server responds."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0042","technique":"T1583.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--54fc1f38-f4e3-523e-b07c-73889b0d8df7","120":"instance--9cf45948-7040-5d7a-a1d5-3cb4db0c1af6","150":"instance--13bb13cc-e02b-51d2-8d7d-40e5613b6e5a","180":"instance--e33bc6ee-771e-54fe-a772-74dfdaad420d","210":"instance--286f51a3-8fc6-55ec-978e-8b05ebda3655","240":"instance--14659696-be77-5460-beb1-4b5eac126e43","270":"instance--f48ed1a6-2895-5cd2-9b1c-e30ac2bc8921","30":"instance--7b803e61-16ac-5720-92cd-8f2a456a52b7","300":"instance--76c24361-5143-5c43-8e4d-707c619e6038","330":"instance--f395cfc7-395a-5001-9552-a4fec6dbc53a","60":"instance--760885bb-9294-5a5b-93a2-a410e1ea4112","90":"instance--8e0d1a12-8611-598d-9a7d-40f2525e4781"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--6","properties":[["name","Administer Bazar and TrickBot C2 with same key"],["description","What\u2019s interesting about this particular domain is that the EmerCoin key ( ) used to administer the server, also administers some C&C servers that belong to the Bazar backdoor."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0042","technique":"T1588.004"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--7cccbcd0-a724-54fb-be4f-ac523d26f7d0","120":"instance--738e44b2-1357-5eb3-82bd-8a0ce8942b72","150":"instance--d31f4735-6339-5929-8d7c-d30863cf166f","180":"instance--2252393d-d801-5931-ad38-4b53374a9880","210":"instance--065b5ad5-023a-5336-b458-e9c9dcda2976","240":"instance--5ea0dd2b-5eac-51f8-855a-4cbcb801bc2d","270":"instance--bba66874-a069-56c6-bb95-967cb3cefc9e","30":"instance--6377c09d-ecb4-5567-a2f4-4dde56ff4f98","300":"instance--ede3430f-b16b-58ae-be71-1d1f1a194336","330":"instance--7772f482-8ee2-569a-b600-7528c065d4e0","60":"instance--98139a98-16b0-54fe-8c77-3473c1b520cd","90":"instance--5cb9cc95-e190-5a68-985d-0a94d39299e6"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--7","properties":[["name","Resolve backup domain to IP and server"],["description","The analyzed sample ( ) uses the domain, which has the 81.91.234.196 IP address and running ."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1071.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--5150f7cc-6f25-5eb3-a6fc-5099ced4caf4","120":"instance--64a408ce-c543-55d6-a9dd-206ce7cadbb2","150":"instance--1b71e413-cfd2-528c-8792-dc7dd1bb9938","180":"instance--aa12ce11-0165-52b6-b72d-e4d9070e9fbb","210":"instance--5d8b0f08-14bc-58f4-9316-b25a92dd09a6","240":"instance--34f96b84-9453-53f2-ae07-d28c04665e6c","270":"instance--415f1d54-1cd4-5ba7-8071-4aa99bc946ac","30":"instance--18834cac-b4c4-57b0-88ea-5a62fdb27cf9","300":"instance--de4f9957-1ac6-5782-86ea-f1a3b6a9ad13","330":"instance--8eff940b-86bb-556f-8c85-c7c47577b3ed","60":"instance--14a123fd-5626-5e69-8257-6dcd64c28ec0","90":"instance--02294ff1-7261-5db8-8e0d-b9e818922053"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--8","properties":[["name","Eliminate Tor plugin services"],["description","TrickBot operators have apparently eliminated the Tor plugin services and have added the new tags, which seem to be obfuscated IPs, a technique also used by the Bazar backdoor."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1090.003"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--180f2983-9c1a-56f4-99d6-c990125f7baa","120":"instance--c7f65318-7600-57f4-a8ac-992357e695ff","150":"instance--95523e1a-0a1d-52ef-944c-23f9cbc50233","180":"instance--bc8eb48d-411d-5877-aa9b-966476b71207","210":"instance--4cc5026e-07f9-5327-9912-5d278a0a3321","240":"instance--d6a7d51d-39a4-5eb3-8831-f23437781b95","270":"instance--cac30e05-5f01-5b4f-b5c0-6b975297df2d","30":"instance--cb0751b0-c027-5895-a460-a72e48920c71","300":"instance--f41cdc1f-abb7-5ff7-81c2-bf2235a7faab","330":"instance--b114cbda-9ec8-5612-b2f8-93c36811cafb","60":"instance--f28e5296-2041-5fe9-992d-4c70d549191e","90":"instance--3ea39244-da0f-5435-8745-f2afa8b13872"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--9","properties":[["name","Add obfuscated IP tags"],["description","TrickBot operators have apparently eliminated the Tor plugin services and have added the new tags, which seem to be obfuscated IPs, a technique also used by the Bazar backdoor. Although these look like legitimate IP address, they\u2019re not."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--db5fab04-54d4-5eec-a429-185861eb2719","120":"instance--985391bd-d017-5935-ab31-3b4b56331b02","150":"instance--092bb98d-fc30-5f69-b6b7-e3024f3ec65a","180":"instance--755129e6-612e-5b63-a780-1c886d98909b","210":"instance--431723d9-dd8c-5190-9dab-6f346173c044","240":"instance--5b9fb821-54fe-5f22-bba3-038263245910","270":"instance--3c6777cb-6430-544b-b31a-01b198524553","30":"instance--c070071b-a9a3-52fe-8956-a51744db200b","300":"instance--a9a4289c-d995-5783-9544-a8b45052eb56","330":"instance--344009cc-e024-5c68-9246-51e85e00d45c","60":"instance--86c77621-2c1d-59c3-b398-e62f4b48a3dd","90":"instance--67627b08-1913-5f3d-8318-52d3bda9c1c3"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--10","properties":[["name","Reduce C2 server count"],["description","The tag appears to only be used for C&C servers, a number that seems to have been reduced considerably compared to previous TrickBot versions."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0042","technique":"T1583.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-360